An unterminated comment fence in a list item is the line form

```
- x
  %%%
y
.
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
<p>y</p>
```

```
- x
  %% z
y
.
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
<p>y</p>
```

